  "about": "Campaign plan sources. tools/campaign.py build turns this into campaign/targets/<tag>.json and campaign/manifest.json. Version rule (manuscript 4.6, RQ4): the latest release and the two preceding minor releases at the freeze; where an implementation has no minor-release structure, releases spanning the preceding 24 months. Base files come first-wins: an entry whose key is already present is skipped, so the validated current-version entries (smoke files) take precedence over older drift files.",
